OL,3,GNEWSAThe Californian whose pumpkin
OL,4,Apatch dream took root in Fife
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Cameron Laird introduced
OL,7,Fpumpkin-picking to her husband John's
OL,8,Ffarm 28 years ago, she was trying to
OL,9,Fbring a treasured piece of her American
OL,10,Fchildhood to her new Scottish home.
OL,12,FShe remembered the dozens of pumpkin
OL,13,Ffarms that lined the roads near her
OL,14,Fhome in California and was keen to
OL,15,Fbring the tradition to Scotland where
OL,16,Fit had not yet taken root.
OL,18,FAlmost three decades later, Cairnie
OL,19,FFruit Farm near Cupar in Fife grows
OL,20,F20,000 pumpkins every year and welcome
OL,21,Fthousands of visitors from all over
OL,22,FScotland and beyond.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
