OL,3,GNEWSAThe Californian whose pumpkin
OL,4,Apatch dream took root in Fife
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe success of Cameron's idea reflects
OL,7,Fa wider boom in pumpkin patches, with
OL,8,Fmany farmers now diversifying into
OL,9,F"experiences" that draw crowds long
OL,10,Fafter other crops are harvested.
